<script language="JavaScript" type="text/javascript">
function Accept() {
	window.location = "http://rtd-denver.websitetoolbox.com";
}

function Decline()
{
	
	window.location = "/operator/secure/index.do";
	
}
</script>

<div id="mainContent">
<div align="left">
<table width="950px" align="left" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="bodyTable4" id="wrapperTable">
	<tr>
	<td>
		<table width="90%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
			<tr>
				<td class="bodyBlue"><br>
					<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#000000" align="center">
					  <tr>
					    <td><table width="100%" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" summary="Nested table">
					      <tr>
					        <td style="text-align:justify"><p>This  Bulletin Board is for constructive discussion in order to improve the communication between various departments such as Operations (Bus and LRT),  Dispatch, TIC, Platte/East Metro, Contracted Operator Divisions, Special  Services and Service Planning/Scheduling. Use of this Bulletin Board  must be in a manner  consistent with RTD's standards of business conduct.</p>
					          <p><strong>Use of this Bulletin  Board, or any other general suggestion systems, is not a requirement/nor obligation of your work functions and is not compensable.</strong></p>
					          <p>This bulletin board <strong>shall  not</strong> be used contrary to RTD's Email, Internet and Computer Use Policy; any  user of this bulletin board is presumed to be aware of this policy. No user shall post <strong><u>inappropriate content including but not  limited to</u></strong>, the following: <strong>(1)</strong> sexually suggestive materials, pornography, obscenity, or offensive images, graphics or language; <strong>(2)</strong> unlicensed  or unauthorized access to proprietary or copyrighted information; <strong>(3)</strong> material that is perceived as  offensive based on RTD's EEO and harassment policies; <strong>(4)</strong> solicitation of business unrelated to RTD's business activities; and <strong>(5)</strong> gambling or any  illegal activity. No user shall disclose  confidential information on this Bulletin Board or use this forum to resolve  personal disputes or to make defamatory statements about other individuals.</p>
					          <p>The Bulletin Board is not a complaint forum. Employees should submit complaints according to the policies and  procedures otherwise specified in the RTD's Rules, Regulations, Performance  Code and Policies, Trailblazer or Salaried Employee Handbook.</p>
					          <p>The information posted on this Bulletin Board is not private, confidential or a public forum. RTD will monitor the  postings on this Bulletin Board and reserves the right to remove or edit any  posting without any prior notice or approval by the user.</p>
					          <p>If you have any questions or concerns, contact the Moderator before posting any comments on this Bulletin Board.<br />
					          <br /></p></td>
					      </tr>
					      <tr>
					        <td style="text-align:center">
							  <input name="button" type="button" id="button" value="Accept" ONCLICK="Accept();"> 
					          <input name="button" type="button" id="button" value="Decline" onClick="Decline();">
					          <br />
					          <br /></td>
					      </tr>
					    </table></td>
					  </tr>
					</table>
				</td>		
			</tr>
		</table>
</td>
	</tr>
</table>
</div>
